<noinclude>
Stores a job as SMW properties (Tt name/customer/description/status/estimate). Created and edited via [[Form:Job]]. The
page title is a stable random id and <code>customer</code> stores the customer's page id, so a job (or its customer)
can be renamed without moving pages, and two customers may reuse a job name. The name is shown via
<code>DISPLAYTITLE</code>.
[[Category:Time tracker templates]]
</noinclude><includeonly>{{#default_form:Job}}{{#set:
|Tt name={{{name|}}}
|Tt customer={{{customer|}}}
|Tt description={{{description|}}}
|Tt status={{{status|active}}}
|Tt estimate={{{estimate|}}}
}}{{DISPLAYTITLE:{{{name|{{PAGENAME}}}}}}}<div class="tt-header-row"><div class="tt-card tt-entity">
<div class="tt-facts">
<div class="tt-fact"><span class="tt-fact-label">Customer</span><span class="tt-fact-value">{{#if:{{{customer|}}}|[[{{{customer}}}]]|—}}</span></div>
<div class="tt-fact"><span class="tt-fact-label">Status</span><span class="tt-fact-value"><span class="tt-badge tt-badge-{{lc:{{{status|active}}}}}">{{int:timetracker-status-{{lc:{{{status|active}}}}}}}</span></span></div>
{{#if:{{{estimate|}}}|<div class="tt-fact"><span class="tt-fact-label">Estimate</span><span class="tt-fact-value">{{#timetracker_format_duration:{{{estimate}}}}}</span></div>|}}
</div>{{#if:{{{description|}}}|<div class="tt-desc">{{{description}}}</div>|}}
</div>{{#timetracker_jobtimer:{{FULLPAGENAME}}}}</div>
<h2 class="tt-section">📋 Tasks</h2>
<div class="tt-jobs-row">{{#timetracker_tile:newtask|{{FULLPAGENAME}}}}{{#timetracker_tasks:{{FULLPAGENAME}}}}</div>
<h2 class="tt-section">⏱️ Time entries</h2>
{{#timetracker_timetable:job|{{FULLPAGENAME}}}}
{{#timetracker_progress:{{FULLPAGENAME}}|{{{estimate|}}}}}
[[Category:Jobs]]
</includeonly>
